findings.claim:
New in C6c. In the first 250 px of scrolling the fixed bar slides away, comes back, then slides away again:
- it waits while the color dots cross its strip;
- it returns once they are above it;
- 50-60 px later the inline ask enters the window and the bar goes 'off'.
That is three 0.2 s slides within about a fifth of a screen, on the first scroll of every tablet product page.
